stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Draft
  Draft --> Validating: publish requested
  Validating --> Published: schema and policy pass
  Validating --> Draft: validation fails
  Published --> Running: trigger received
  Running --> WaitingApproval: approval step
  WaitingApproval --> Running: approved
  WaitingApproval --> Rejected: rejected
  Running --> Completed: all steps complete
  Running --> RetryScheduled: transient failure
  RetryScheduled --> Running: retry
  Running --> Failed: permanent/max retries
  Published --> Disabled: admin disables
  Completed --> [*]
  Failed --> [*]
  Rejected --> [*]
